# Comment-to-DM lead funnel (Fase 7) — Meta webhook + private replies.
# INSTAGRAM_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN: any random string you choose; enter the
#   same value in the Meta App Dashboard's webhook subscription setup.
INSTAGRAM_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN=""
# INSTAGRAM_APP_SECRET: from the Meta App Dashboard, used to verify the
#   X-Hub-Signature-256 header on incoming webhook deliveries.
INSTAGRAM_APP_SECRET=""
# INSTAGRAM_PRIVATE_REPLIES_ENABLED: feature flag, default OFF. Set to the
#   literal string "true" to send real private replies via the Meta Graph
#   API; any other value (including unset) uses the mock/simulation
#   provider and never makes a real network call.
INSTAGRAM_PRIVATE_REPLIES_ENABLED=""
